========================================================================
EXTENSION — final production restoration (2026-11-12, 21:00 UTC)
========================================================================

The five patches above (#48–#52) staged recovery but production stayed
degraded: the sync was writing env entries that production deployments
could not see, and the Vercel free-tier daily deploy quota (exhausted by
the day's churn) kept blocking redeployments. The two patches below are
the last mile — after they merged, the 20:59 UTC workflow run deployed
both sites and they came back healthy at 21:00 (client) / 21:34 (admin) UTC.
Vercel's api-projects-get rate limit (>300/h) is why the sync log ends
with repair-mode PATCHes; per-key successes plus the healthy endpoints
are the evidence the values landed.

